### CodeClash - Problem Catalog API Tests
### Base Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5003

# SECTION 0: Authentication (Protected Endpoints require session cookie)

### 0. Login to establish authenticated session cookie
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "adi.test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

# SECTION 1: Standard Catalog Listing & Default Pagination

### 1. List published problems - default pagination (page=1, limit=20)
# Expect: 200 OK
# Response should contain "problems" array and "pagination" object:
# {
#   "problems": [
#     { "slug": "...", "title": "...", "difficulty": "...", "topics": [...] }
#   ],
#   "pagination": { "page": 1, "limit": 20, "total": ..., "totalPages": ... }
# }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems

# SECTION 2: Pagination Tests

### 2. Page 1 with custom limit of 2 items
# Expect: 200 OK with up to 2 problems
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?page=1&limit=2

### 3. Page 2 with custom limit of 2 items (next page)
# Expect: 200 OK with distinct next set of problems
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?page=2&limit=2

### 4. High page number exceeding total pages
# Expect: 200 OK with "problems": [], valid total count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?page=999&limit=20

# SECTION 3: Difficulty Filtering (EASY, MEDIUM, HARD)

### 5. Filter by EASY difficulty
# Expect: 200 OK, every returned problem must have difficulty "EASY"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?difficulty=EASY

### 6. Filter by MEDIUM difficulty
# Expect: 200 OK, every returned problem must have difficulty "MEDIUM"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?difficulty=MEDIUM

### 7. Filter by HARD difficulty
# Expect: 200 OK, every returned problem must have difficulty "HARD"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?difficulty=HARD

# SECTION 4: Topic Filtering

### 8. Filter by topic "Array"
# Expect: 200 OK, all problems must contain "Array" in their topics array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?topic=Array

### 9. Filter by topic with whitespace "Hash Table"
# Expect: 200 OK, all problems must contain "Hash Table" in their topics array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?topic=Hash%20Table

### 10. Filter by non-existent topic
# Expect: 200 OK with "problems": [] and "total": 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?topic=NonExistentTopic123

# SECTION 5: Search Filtering (Title and Slug matching)

### 11. Search by exact slug or title prefix ("two")
# Expect: 200 OK, matches "two-sum" / "Two Sum"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?search=two

### 12. Search case-insensitively ("SUBARRAY")
# Expect: 200 OK, matches "subarray-sum-equals-k"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?search=SUBARRAY

### 13. Search matching multiple problems ("sum")
# Expect: 200 OK, matches "two-sum" and "subarray-sum-equals-k"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?search=sum

### 14. Search with no matches
# Expect: 200 OK with "problems": [] and "total": 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?search=nonexistenttermxyz

# SECTION 6: Combined Filters (Search + Difficulty + Topic + Pagination)

### 15. Search + Difficulty + Topic + Pagination
# Expect: 200 OK, matching only problems satisfying all criteria simultaneously
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?search=sum&difficulty=EASY&topic=Array&page=1&limit=10

### 16. Medium difficulty + Array topic
# Expect: 200 OK, returns medium problems tagged with Array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?difficulty=MEDIUM&topic=Array&page=1&limit=10

# SECTION 7: Validation & Edge Cases (Expected 400 Bad Request)

### 17. Invalid difficulty value - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?difficulty=EXTREME

### 18. Lowercase difficulty value (schema expects uppercase) - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?difficulty=easy

### 19. Non-numeric page - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?page=first

### 20. Zero page (page must be >= 1) - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?page=0

### 21. Negative page - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?page=-1

### 22. Non-numeric limit - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?limit=ten

### 23. Zero limit (limit must be >= 1) - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?limit=0

### 24. Limit exceeding maximum allowed (e.g. > 100) - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?limit=250

### 25. Excessively long search string - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems?search=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa

# SECTION 8: Problem Detail Endpoint (GET /api/problems/:slug)

### 26. Get published problem detail by slug - expect 200 OK
# Verifies problem metadata, statement markdown, limits, and public starter templates.
# Must NOT contain testCases or fullDriverTemplate.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems/two-sum

### 27. Get another published problem - expect 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems/majority-element

### 28. Get medium difficulty problem - expect 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems/subarray-sum-equals-k

### 29. Unknown problem slug - expect 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems/unknown-problem-slug

### 30. Malformed slug (invalid characters/case) - expect 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/problems/Two_Sum!

